# Purpose

The Software Factory Pipeline defines the standardized engineering workflow used by the Cryptic Vision Platform to design, verify, build, package, and evolve software.

Unlike a traditional development pipeline, the Software Factory is governed by the Occult Grammar Protocol (OGP), ensuring that every engineering action follows a repeatable verification-first methodology.

The goal is not simply to produce software, but to create stable, observable, expandable engineering systems.

